OL,3,GNEWSA'I have the world's biggest My
OL,4,ALittle Pony collection'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has entered the world record
OL,7,Fbooks for officially having the largest
OL,8,Fcollection of My Little Pony
OL,9,Fmemorabilia on the planet.
OL,11,FMiranda Worby, 43, from Lowestoft in
OL,12,FSuffolk, first became obsessed with the
OL,13,Ftoys as a child after her parents said
OL,14,Fno to her plea for a real horse.
OL,16,FAs a teenager she started her
OL,17,Fcollection, trying to find ones she did
OL,18,Fnot have, and over the next 30 years
OL,19,Fshe amassed a collection of 4,550 items
OL,20,F- which fill an entire room in her
OL,21,Fhouse as well as a storage unit.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
